## Summary
An email claiming a bomb has been installed was sent to all district courts nationwide. Police have launched a search to investigate the threat.

## Key Points
- Threat email was sent to district courts across the country.
- Police are conducting a search in response to the threat.
- The email mentions bomb installation.
- The incident is a nationwide security concern.


